    "func": "// Luu trang thai do THIET BI bao ve, khong phai thu nguoi vua bam.\n// Giao dien phai hien cai thiet bi DANG THE NAO — hai thu do khac nhau va chi\n// cai dau la that.\nflow.set('dev_state', msg.payload);\nreturn null;",
